      "rationale": "'חמס שותה' — fiɲɛ min: Heburu kuma min bɛ fɔ ko kɛrɛnkɛrɛnnen don, a kɔrɔ ye juya min bɛ don a kɔnɔ ye."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "senw ge",
      "rationale": "Misali fila: nɔ-ge ani fiɲɛ-min — u bɛ wuli kelen na walasa k'a jira ko kuma ci gɛlɛyabaga bolo, o bɛ nɔgɔya tiɲɛ wuli."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Mɔgɔ min bɛ kumaw ci gɛlɛyabaga bolo, o ye mɔgɔ ye min bɛ senw ge ani min bɛ fiɲɛ min.",
